reference/SLT-REF-03-failed-renewal-retry-schedule-attempt-count-grace-day-timest.md:72:**Effective on-hold moment** = first hourly `arraysubs_check_overdue_renewals` tick where `now > max(D + 1 day, D + offset + 1h)`. With offset ≤ 6 h, `D + 1 day` dominates. So: **≈ D + 24h, rounded up to the next hourly sweep.**
reference/SLT-REF-03-failed-renewal-retry-schedule-attempt-count-grace-day-timest.md:79:- `RenewalProcessor::cancelOverdueSubscription()` (`:756`, impl `RenewalProcessor.php:139-174`): status → `arraysubs-cancelled`; `_end_date`, `_cancelled_date` = now; `_cancelled_by = 'system'`; `_cancellation_reason = 'overdue_payment'`; cancels every unpaid renewal order (`cancelPendingRenewalOrders()` `:182-263`); `RenewalScheduler::unschedule()`; `do_action('arraysubs_data_cancelled_overdue')`.
