+
+Observation date: 2026-08-10 (D08)
+Context: watch-level natural Paddle sandbox renewal; no Action Scheduler row was run and no site state was mutated.
+
+## Immutable pre-gate boundary
+
+- Authored remote gate: `2026-08-10T10:20:38.143985Z` / `16:20:38.143985` site (UTC+6).
+- State/API preflight: `2026-08-10T10:13:24Z` / `16:13:26` site.
+- Mailpit baseline revalidated inside the exact five-minute window at `2026-08-10 16:15:47` site.
+- `MAIL_PRE=56ugkHpFaRuFCoyKaal00u`.
+- Exact relationship: subscription `12639`, customer `352`, product `12112`, gateway `arraysubs_paddle`, Paddle subscription `sub_01kz8q1025tryjfgxvn5e3v4gf`.
+- Pre-state: `arraysubs-active`; completed payments `5`; last payment `2026-08-09 10:21:16Z`; local next payment `2026-08-11 10:20:38Z`; local stored card last4 `4242`.
+- Sanitized Paddle preflight: status `active`, collection mode `automatic`, day/1 billing cycle, no scheduled change, remote `next_billed_at=2026-08-10T10:20:38.143985Z`.
+- Exact local actions `16405` (invoice, `2026-08-11 04:26:48Z`) and `16406` (charge, `2026-08-11 10:26:48Z`) were pending and unattempted. They are the skewed D9 pair and were not run or forced.
+- Latest relationship order before the gate: `13480`, completed for `$11.00` at `2026-08-09 10:21:14Z`, transaction `txn_01kzk0mpqxf7w1tpdcdyna8n9v`.
+- API credentials, management URLs, customer/address payloads, and full payment payloads were neither printed nor stored.
+
+## Post-gate result
+
+- Paddle transaction `txn_01kznk1e8p98v536yf9fnv41kv` is `completed`, origin `subscription_recurring`, and belongs to the exact remote subscription.
+- Paddle billed at `2026-08-10T10:21:06.710325Z`, captured once at `10:21:08.737995Z`, for `1100` USD minor units (`$11.00`) on Visa ending `5556`.
+- Paddle remains active and advanced `next_billed_at` exactly one day to `2026-08-11T10:20:38.143985Z`.
+- Exact local order `13617` is `wc-completed`, customer `352`, gateway `arraysubs_paddle`, `$11.00`, with HPOS transaction `txn_01kznk1e8p98v536yf9fnv41kv` and reverse `_subscription_id=_subscription_renewal=12639`.
+- Subscription `12639` remains active; completed payments advanced `5→6`; last payment is `2026-08-10 10:21:19Z`; retry and pending-order metas are absent.
+- The complete Mailpit delta after `MAIL_PRE` contains exactly two messages:
+  - `0Ku58j3hM2B97uYkb6HeOj` — `[mirror-help.arrayhash.com]: You've got a new order: #13617` — `admin@mirror-help.arrayhash.com`.
+  - `2uApI9cIbIcnehcFQhXMJA` — `[mirror-help.arrayhash.com] Payment received for subscription #12639` — `slt-paddle@example.test`; body reports `$11.00`, Paddle, and next payment `12 August, 2026 4:20 PM (UTC+6)`.
+- No renewal-invoice, payment-failed, on-hold, or retry message appeared in the complete owner delta.
+- Customer UI proof: `/home/server-manager/slt-evidence/D08-Paddle-12639-subscription-after.png` shows the active subscription, completed `$11.00` order `13617`, local next payment `12 August`, and stale local Visa ending `4242`.
+- Customer order proof: `/home/server-manager/slt-evidence/D08-Paddle-12639-order-13617.png` shows Completed / `$11.00` / Paddle with an empty product table and `$0.00` subtotal. Browser errors were empty; console output contained informational JQMIGRATE messages only.
+
+## Recurring known defects
+
+- The one-day schedule skew persists: remote next billing is D9 (`2026-08-11`), while local next payment is D10 (`2026-08-12`). Unattempted D9 actions `16405/16406` were cancelled and D10 actions `16776/16777` were queued.
+- Local card meta/UI remains Visa ending `4242` although the exact captured recurring payment used Visa ending `5556`.
+- Order `13617` has no `_paddle_transaction_id`, no `_last_gateway_transaction_id`, no renewal cycle/scheduled-date meta, and zero order-item rows despite its paid `$11.00` total.
+- Subscription `_last_gateway_transaction_id` is still the initial-checkout transaction `txn_01kz8pz26xhc4cyhm6m3m6dw9x`, not the current renewal transaction.
+- These are recurrences of existing findings and are appended there; no duplicate issue file was created.
